      "title": "Failure Flow",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Employee 700 returns ACCOUNT_CLOSED: mark only that request/item FAILED. The 1,999 successful payments remain successful. BANK_TIMEOUT is UNKNOWN, not a final failure, and prevents final closure until resolved. An approved payroll item is corrected through a separately audited adjustment, never silent recalculation."
          ]
        },
