      "title": "Retry Flow",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "paragraphs": [
            "For a timed-out SAL-2026-09-EMP0001, query the bank by that same reference before retrying. A confirmed pre-submission technical failure can retry safely under the same identity; a changed beneficiary after ACCOUNT_CLOSED requires an authorized correction linked to the original obligation."
